{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も一日お疲れちまぁ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は学校行ってからの、撮影でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/07/25/7878557/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲリラ豪雨があったり、少し涼しいかな？と思ったら、蒸し暑かったり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変なお天気が続いていますが、みなさん大丈夫ですか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱中症にも気をつけなければいけませんが、クーラー病にも要注意ですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話は変わりますが、日奈はね先日、カフェでココナッツアイスを食べました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/07/25/7878557/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これがまたとっても美味しかったのです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バニラアイスや、抹茶アイスはよく食べますが、ココナッツクリームのアイスは初めてで、ちょっと感激しました(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんのり口の中に広がるココナッツ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷たいアイスが体をひんやりさせてくれます(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏はアイスがとっても美味しく感じる♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏といえば..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの天敵...蚊が活発化？する季節ですね(Ｔ＿Ｔ)秋もかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも日奈、嬉しいことに蚊に全く刺されないんですよ(^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お友達と一緒にいると、日奈は1箇所も刺されないのに、お友達だけたくさん刺されているということが多く..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族ともそう...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"血液型で刺されやすいとか、刺されにくいとか聞きますが本当にあるみたい^^;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに日奈はA型。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく刺されるお姉ちゃん、お母さんはO型です( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今夏の初刺されは、あすかと川後さんと行ったお祭り。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よりによって、ほっぺに大っきく刺されちゃいました（；＿；）笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれ一回だけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"刺されないという記録！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逃げ切りたいですね！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかり蚊除け対策しなくっちゃ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はまた学校行ってからの、リハーサルです☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張りますー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【7月22日 てぃまさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【7月24日 もとさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【7月25日 なえぼうさん】\n【7月25日 ○◉▲さん】\n【7月25日 まいたんさん】\n【7月25日 てぃまにさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆HAPPY BIRTHDAY☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な一年になります様に☆*:."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/07/25/7878557/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑ズームまりかと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪にうもれる日奈(o^^o)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは...明日もみなさんにとって幸せであります様に☆*:."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また余裕ができたら、大草原の小さなお部屋でのお話し会しましょうね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この辺でおやすみなさい(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈"}],"source":"archive"}